///1ED
Help by Willem Aandewiel
ED - CP/M-86 command-driven text editor

///2STARTING
  A>ED NOTES.TXT

Enter editing commands at ED's prompt.

///2NEWFILE
Enter I, then Return. Type your text.
Press Ctrl-Z to leave insertion mode.
Enter E to save and exit.

///2READING
For an existing file, enter:

  #A
  B
  #T

#A fills the buffer from the file; large files may not fit.
B selects the beginning. #T displays the remaining buffer.

///2SAVING
E saves and exits.
Q discards this session's changes; confirm when asked.
Use ED for text such as HELP.A86, not binary HELP.CMD.
